{"ref":"BDB, יַעֲרֵי אֹרְגִים","hw":"יַעֲרֵי אֹרְגִים","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יַעֲרֵי אֹרְגִים</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> father of <em>Elḥanan</em> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.19\">2 S 21:19</a> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">יָעִו֯ר</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.5\">1 Ch 20:5</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> prob. scribal error anticipating <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> in foll. line (We Dr), and <span dir=\"rtl\">יַעֲרֵי</span> error for <span dir=\"rtl\">יָעִיר</span> (We) q.v. sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, עור\" href=\"/BDB,_עור\", dir=\"rtl\">עור</a>.","next":"BDB, יְעָרִים","prev":"BDB, יַעְרָה²"}